# --- Fetch intermediates (reproducible via scripts/, never hand-curated) ---
# NOTE: data/corpus/ is deliberately committed, not ignored. EUR-Lex's WAF
# blocks the live fetch from CI runners, and the corpus is the fixed substrate
# the eval baseline is measured against -- it must be a stable, versioned
# artifact, not re-fetched live. Refresh it with scripts/fetch_corpus.py.
data/eu_ai_act_raw.html
data/eu_ai_act_raw_files/
data/golden_set_candidates.jsonl

# --- Eval run artifacts (see CLAUDE.md: never hand-edit these) ---
eval/results.json
eval/.cache/

